# Final Boss - The Dark Lord Confrontation
# Epic finale featuring all elements, intense drama, and the ultimate battle

@backdrop textures/sewer-lava.gif [fadeIn=1000]
@char HERO sprite=characters/male
@char DARK_LORD sprite=npc/air-knight
@char ELDER sprite=characters/female

@do playBgm [name=audio/deep-unknown-beat.mp3]

wait 1000

# The Dark Lord Awakens

*DARK_LORD: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
At last... a worthy challenger approaches!
I have watched your journey, mortal.
"""

wait 700

HERO: [expression=worried,position=left]
"""
The Dark Lord... in person...
The legends didn't do you justice.
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/organ.mp3]

wait 600

DARK_LORD: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
A thousand years I've waited!
The seal weakens... my power returns!
You think four little shards can stop ME?
"""

wait 700

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=smile]
"""
These aren't just shards!
They're the lessons of Fire, Water,
Earth, and Air! Combined they make...
"""

wait 600

@transition wipe [duration=500]

wait 500

@backdrop textures/temple.gif [fadeIn=700]
@do playBgm [name=audio/brass-loop.mp3]

# The Battle Begins

DARK_LORD: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
ENOUGH TALK! Show me this 'power'!
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/dungeon-beat.mp3]

wait 500

HERO: [expression=neutral,position=left]
"""
Fire taught me PASSION!
"""

@action HERO moveTo [x=20,duration=300]

wait 400

HERO: [expression=neutral,position=left]
"""
Water taught me ADAPTATION!
"""

wait 400

HERO: [expression=neutral,position=left]
"""
Earth taught me ENDURANCE!
"""

wait 400

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=smile]
"""
And Air taught me FREEDOM!
Together they form the ultimate power...
THE SPIRIT OF A TRUE HERO!
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/brass-loop.mp3]

wait 800

@transition fadeOutBackdrop [duration=400]

wait 500

@backdrop textures/sewer-lava.gif [fadeIn=500]
@do playBgm [name=audio/distorted-communication.mp3]

# The Tide Turns

DARK_LORD: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
Impossible! My darkness... fading?!
How can a mere mortal...?!
"""

wait 600

HERO: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
Because I fight for everyone!
For the village! For the kingdom!
For everyone who believed in me!
"""

wait 600

*DARK_LORD: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
No... NOOOOO!
The seal... it's reforming!
A THOUSAND MORE YEARS?!
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/organ.mp3]

wait 800

@transition wipe [duration=600]

wait 600

@backdrop textures/room.gif [fadeIn=800]
@do playBgm [name=audio/dawns-peak.mp3]

# Victory

DARK_LORD: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
You... have won... this time...
But darkness... never dies...
In a thousand years... I will return...
"""

wait 700

HERO: [expression=neutral,position=left]
"""
And in a thousand years, there will be
another hero to stop you. That's the
cycle of light and darkness.
"""

*DARK_LORD: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
Perhaps... you are... worthy after all...
Until we meet again... HERO...
"""

@transition fadeOutBackdrop [duration=1000]

wait 1000

@backdrop textures/castle.gif [fadeIn=900]
@do playBgm [name=audio/calm-escape.mp3]

# The Aftermath

ELDER: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
You did it! The Dark Lord is sealed!
The kingdom is saved!
"""

wait 600

HERO: [expression=smile,position=right]
"""
I couldn't have done it alone.
The elementals, the Knight, you...
Everyone helped me reach this moment.
"""

*ELDER: [cutin=size=large,expression=smile]
"""
You are truly a hero of legend now!
Songs will be sung of your deeds
for a thousand years!
"""

wait 800

HERO: [expression=smile,position=right]
"""
A thousand years, huh?
That's when he comes back...
I hope the next hero is ready.
"""

@transition wipe [duration=600]

waitInput

@end
